2138:   /* The legacy NDJSON RPC listener was removed: aimee-server serves only the
2139:    * /v1 HTTP surface (server_http.c binds its own UDS + optional TCP). No Unix
2140:    * RPC socket is created here, so there is no stale-socket / symlink check and
2141:    * no capability token to load. `fd` stays -1 so the shared error-cleanup paths
2142:    * below remain valid no-ops (close(-1) and unlink of an absent path). */
2143:   int fd = -1;
