27: *   - the roll-up is ready only when every dependency sampled `ok`.
28: *
29: * Tuning (env, so an operator can adjust without a rebuild; conservative
30: * defaults chosen so the probe never becomes load):
31: *   AIMEE_READY_INTERVAL_SECS  sampling period  (default 15, range 1..3600)
